 "message": "A 9-frame dust burst in beige and grey: a small puff on frame 1 that swells into a wide, low cloud around frames 4 to 6, then thins and settles into scattered specks by frame 8. Built from the slam dust part with a flattened ground camera (tilt 0.3) and a dark outline; the palette is four beige-to-grey tones. The cloud reads more as scattered puffs than one solid mass, so the Dust size and Puff sliders are the ones to try for a thicker billow.",
